        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pull Trim with Rim Lock Cylinder for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Night Latch Function Pull Trim with <a href=\"/products/rim-cylinder-lock-global-th1100-rc\">Rim Lock Cylinder</a> (turn key to retract latch, release/remove key to engage latch) for Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-stainless-steel-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbarss\"><b>Stainless Steel Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Exit Devices</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/44-inch-grade-2-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-edtbar44\"><b>44 Inch Rim Exit Devices</b></a> and others.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/pull-plate-trim-for-exit-device-global-th1100-pldum-al\"><b>Pull Plate Only (no lock hole)</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with rim lock cylinder, pull trim, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Global TH1100-PLED-RC Pull Trim with Rim Cylinder \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Night Latch - Turn key to retract door latch on exit device, release/remove key to re-engage.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Aluminum </li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Includes Trim Ring</li>\r\n<li>Standard Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
